<div class="modal-content">
    <div class="modal-header">
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal">&times;</button>
        <h4 class="modal-title">Master Asmin Screen Help</h4>
    </div>
    <div class="modal-body">

        <h3>Master User Admin:</h3>
        <p style="text-decoration: underline"> How to add a user:</p>
        <p>Navigate to the upper left corner of the dashboard and select, “Master Users”;</p>

        <img src="~/assets/help/master-admin-1.jpg" />
        <br /><br /><br />
        <p>Next click the “Add” button at the bottom of user list;</p>
        <img src="~/assets/help/master-admin-2.jpg" />
        <br /><br /><br />
        <p style="text-decoration: underline"> How to edit an existing user:</p>
        <p>From the user list, find the user and select “edit” to the far right;</p>
        <img src="~/assets/help/master-admin-3.jpg" />
        <br /><br /><br />
        <p>Once you select “edit”, you can modify the user information as needed. Once updated, please hit save;</p>
        <img src="~/assets/help/master-admin-4.jpg" style="max-width: 800px;" />
        <br /><br /><br />
        <p style="text-decoration: underline"> How to delete a user:</p>
        <p>From the Edit User page, you can delate a user by selecting “actions” to the far right and “delete”</p>

        <p>
            From the user screen, please fill in appropriate user contact information and be sure to select the proper “Role” and “Company” for the user;
        </p>
        <img src="~/assets/help/master-admin-5.jpg" style="max-width: 800px;" />
        <br /><br /><br />
        <p>Once proper information is populated, please select “Is Active” and then hit “Submit” at the bottom of the add user page;</p>
        <img src="~/assets/help/master-admin-6.jpg" />
        <br /><br /><br />
        <p>Once done the user will be sent an auto-generated welcome email with further instructions on how to gain access and to set their password.</p>
        <img src="~/assets/help/master-admin-7.jpg" />
        <br /><br /><br />
        <p>If you need additional assistance or have questions, please email support answer-support@msr-fsr.com</p>




    </div>
    <div class="modal-footer">
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary pull-left" data-toggle="modal" data-target="#supportModal"><i class="fa fa-life-bouy"></i> Open Ticket</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-info" onclick="js:window.print()"><i class="fa fa-print"></i> Print Help</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-warning" data-dismiss="modal"><i class="fa fa-close-o"></i> Close</button>
    </div>
</div>

